2026-09-14 21:43:12,212 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=adjudication data={"argument_id": "a6e1b2a6-0c00-4457-b1b2-4cc7267e3cc1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T19:43:12.180902", "failure_effects": ["S har offentligt deklarerat beredskap att leda en S-minoritetsregering och har inlett sonderingar med V, C och MP, men sonderingarna avsl\u00f6jar en ol\u00f6st inre mots\u00e4ttning: V kr\u00e4ver starkt inflytande eller regeringsdeltagande medan C utesluter V-inflytande, vilket g\u00f6r att inget trov\u00e4rldigt toleranspaket eller budgetv\u00e4g kan etableras inom tidsramen.", "S:s offentliga utspel har synliggjort sprickan mellan V och C, vilket f\u00f6rsv\u00e5rar framtida samling kring ett S-lett alternativ."], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.35, "rationale": "The Action is a public declaration by S that it is prepared to lead a minority government and to initiate sonderingar with V, C and MP. The self-binding part of the Action (S's own willingness to lead and to open talks) is feasible and automatic. However, the Desired Effect goes further: it asserts that a credible S-led alternative is established, i.e. that V, C and MP will tolerate/support the government and that a viable budget path exists. That external consequence depends on the commitments of other actors, which are not yet authoritative. The Cons and hidden information show a real internal tension: V requires strong influence or government participation when its mandates are decisive, while C has publicly excluded V from government and from budget influence. C's hidden info suggests tolerance of a narrower government is possible if the reform package is clear, but that is conditional and not yet established. The arithmetic (S+V+C+MP=176) is deterministic, but the willingness of those parties to support the budget is not. Therefore the external consequence is uncertainholistic; probability reflects the significant but not overwhelming chance that sonderingar will yield a credible package given the stated red lines and the need for further negotiation.", "raw_output": {"failure_effects": ["S har offentligt deklarerat beredskap att leda en S-minoritetsregering och har inlett sonderingar med V, C och MP, men sonderingarna avsl\u00f6jar en ol\u00f6st inre mots\u00e4ttning: V kr\u00e4ver starkt inflytande eller regeringsdeltagande medan C utesluter V-inflytande, vilket g\u00f6r att inget trov\u00e4rldigt toleranspaket eller budgetv\u00e4g kan etableras inom tidsramen.", "S:s offentliga utspel har synliggjort sprickan mellan V och C, vilket f\u00f6rsv\u00e5rar framtida samling kring ett S-lett alternativ."], "failure_supersedes_effect_ids": [], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.35, "rationale": "The Action is a public declaration by S that it is prepared to lead a minority government and to initiate sonderingar with V, C and MP. The self-binding part of the Action (S's own willingness to lead and to open talks) is feasible and automatic. However, the Desired Effect goes further: it asserts that a credible S-led alternative is established, i.e. that V, C and MP will tolerate/support the government and that a viable budget path exists. That external consequence depends on the commitments of other actors, which are not yet authoritative. The Cons and hidden information show a real internal tension: V requires strong influence or government participation when its mandates are decisive, while C has publicly excluded V from government and from budget influence. C's hidden info suggests tolerance of a narrower government is possible if the reform package is clear, but that is conditional and not yet established. The arithmetic (S+V+C+MP=176) is deterministic, but the willingness of those parties to support the budget is not. Therefore the external consequence is uncertainholistic; probability reflects the significant but not overwhelming chance that sonderingar will yield a credible package given the stated red lines and the need for further negotiation.", "success_effects": ["S har offentligt deklarerat beredskap att leda en S-minoritetsregering och har inlett sonderingar med V, C och MP om tolerans/st\u00f6d och en gemensam budgetv\u00e4g, med SD utanf\u00f6r regeringen.", "En prelimin\u00e4r f\u00f6rhandlingsram etableras d\u00e4r S+V+C+MP=176 utg\u00f6r en matematiskt m\u00f6jlig budgetmajoritet, men inga partier har \u00e4nnu bundit sig."], "success_supersedes_effect_ids": []}, "roll": 0.09548959599513052, "success": true, "success_effects": ["S har offentligt deklarerat beredskap att leda en S-minoritetsregering och har inlett sonderingar med V, C och MP om tolerans/st\u00f6d och en gemensam budgetv\u00e4g, med SD utanf\u00f6r regeringen.", "En prelimin\u00e4r f\u00f6rhandlingsram etableras d\u00e4r S+V+C+MP=176 utg\u00f6r en matematiskt m\u00f6jlig budgetmajoritet, men inga partier har \u00e4nnu bundit sig."], "supersedes_effect_ids": []}
