2026-09-15 01:11:37,638 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=adjudication data={"argument_id": "4e584b7d-28cc-446e-9d13-d3bcdecee92a", "created_at": "2026-09-14T23:11:37.416434", "failure_effects": ["S:s \u00e5terpresentation konsoliderar inte 176-majoriteten: V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen kvarst\u00e5r (V:s krav p\u00e5 mycket stort och synligt inflytande uppfylls inte av budgetrollen utanf\u00f6r regeringen; C v\u00e4grar ge V inflytande), och talmannen avst\u00e5r \u00e5ter fr\u00e5n att l\u00e4gga fram S som statsministerf\u00f6rslag.", "Regeringsbildningen forts\u00e4tter i l\u00e5ngvarig l\u00e5sning; S:s alternativ f\u00f6rsvagas ytterligare som f\u00f6rstahandsval inf\u00f6r talmannen och sonderingarna forts\u00e4tter utan ett sammanh\u00e5llet underlag."], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.2, "rationale": "S's presentation of the package is a feasible self-binding act, but the Desired Effect requires external commitments (binding YES from V, C and MP) and the Speaker's decision. Authoritative active Effects repeatedly establish that the V\u2013C contradiction remains unresolved: V's demand for 'mycket stort och synligt inflytande' is not satisfied by the formalized budget cooperation outside government, C refuses to give V influence, and the S+V+C+MP=176 package remains unanchored before the Speaker, who has already declined to put forward S. S's action re-presents essentially the same package without resolving this structural contradiction, so the full Desired Effect (Speaker proposal plus a won 176-vote) is unlikely. Residual uncertainty remains because the Speaker could still test the S path given Tid\u00f6's 173 seats, but the specific 176-majority vote is not credibly anchored.", "raw_output": {"failure_effects": ["S:s \u00e5terpresentation konsoliderar inte 176-majoriteten: V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen kvarst\u00e5r (V:s krav p\u00e5 mycket stort och synligt inflytande uppfylls inte av budgetrollen utanf\u00f6r regeringen; C v\u00e4grar 